    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71,
        826,
        1613,
        1110
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "On May 1, 1958, I shall proclaim May as Senior Citizens Month in New York City. During this period, civic, religious, social, professional and business groups will be asked to participate by paying tribute to the accomplishments of some older person or persons.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.4047,
          "min": -1.6987
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0007,
          "min": -0.0007
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 56,
          "mean": -0.0019,
          "min": -0.0488
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 17067,
        "area_px": 387315,
        "density": 0.04406,
        "chars": 261,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.29
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71,
        1147,
        1688,
        1505
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Many older City employees are proving daily that their dependability and experience constitute a stable foundation for services to the public. The City-wide observance of Senior Citizens Month offers a timely opportunity for the heads of all departments to arrange for some type of acknowledgement of the contributions of senior employees.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2731,
          "min": -1.4066
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 56,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.01
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 19266,
        "area_px": 515880,
        "density": 0.03735,
        "chars": 339,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.6
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71,
        1542,
        1627,
        1741
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "It is particularly important that full publicity be given, during May, not only to staff ceremonies but also to any special departmental services which are of interest and benefit to older residents of New York City.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2347,
          "min": -1.3627
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
